  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro (Red Hot Mama)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Banannas and Blow**: back after 40 archived shows (846 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Little Drummer Boy**: back after 96 archived shows (1516 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Countdown**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **AUde Lang Syne**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Don't Laugh (I Love You)**: back after 45 archived shows (851 days) [4]\n- **Mushroom Festival From Hell**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2011-12-31.mc930.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 35 songs; 163 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **ween2011-12-31.mc930.flac24**: source not stated; 35 songs; 163 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Brown balloons featuring the Boognish logo were dropped from the ceiling [1]\n- Deaner played bass while Dave was absent from the lineup [1]\n- Brown balloons with the Boognish logo fell from the ceiling [2]\n- Deaner played bass while Dave was absent from the lineup [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2011-12-31.mc930.flac16**: taped by Mike B; transferred by Mike B; source: Beyerdynamic MC930 > Naiant Tinybox > Sony M10 (@24/48) [1]\n- **ween2011-12-31.mc930.flac24**: taped by Mike B; transferred by Mike B; source: Beyerdynamic MC930 > Naiant Tinybox > Sony M10 (@24/48) [2]",
